  "summary": "从河边出发按顺序给植物浇水，水不足时必须回河装满再回该植物，求总步数。",
  "insight": "正常从上一植物到当前植物贡献一步。若当前余水不足，当前位置 i 前回河并回来额外走 2i 步，然后浇水。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "浇完后不要求返回河边",
    "水壶容量足够任一单株",
    "下标 i 对应离河 i+1 步"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "remaining-water-simulation",
      "title": "剩余水量模拟",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "逐株判断是否需要在前进前往返河边。",
      "steps": [
        "water=capacity、steps=0",
        "i 遍历：若 water<plants[i]，steps+=2*i、water=capacity",
        "steps++，water-=plants[i]；返回 steps"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/remaining-water-simulation/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/remaining-water-simulation/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/remaining-water-simulation/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
